Rule 6 (x and y must have compatible dtypes from allowed list)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= (dtype_(x) = dtype_(y)) ∧ (dtype_(x) = 7 ∨ dtype_(x) = 8 ∨ dtype_(x) = 9 ∨ dtype_(x) = 4 ∨ dtype_(x) = 5 ∨ dtype_(x) = 10 ∨ dtype_(x) = 11)
